%%% note
mulay の APIkit の雛形 (conn/apikit_scaffold、ADR 097) が作った main フローと実装フローを、実 Mule で動かす。
XML は、listener-config と apikit:config だけのファイルに scaffold の編集を当てたもの (doc:id は固定の値に替えた)。
example のある GET は ee:transform でそれを返し、無い POST・DELETE は logger だけ (payload はそのまま)。
APIKIT の 404/405/406/415 は main の error handler の {message} と状態コード。
%%% port 18566
%%% request GET /api/items
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  {
    "name": "pen"
  }
]
%%% request POST /api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "ink"}
%%% response 201
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{"name": "ink"}
%%% request DELETE /api/items/5
%%% response 204


%%% request GET /api/nope
%%% response 404
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "message": "Resource not found"
}
%%% request PUT /api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{}
%%% response 405
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "message": "Method not allowed"
}
%%% request POST /api/items
Content-Type: text/plain

x
%%% response 415
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "message": "Unsupported media type"
}
%%% request GET /api/items
Accept: text/xml
%%% response 406
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "message": "Not acceptable"
}
